# Errata product

Errata = personal corrections on a cadence. Pin recurring mundane tasks, schedule them, estimate minutes, remind, clear a focused pending list.

## Do

- Optimize for “what’s due now?” and “how long will this take?”
- Treat late completion as normal; reschedule from completion time or fixed cadence per task settings
- Keep copy calm and adult — no shame, no fire emojis required
- Prefer fewer features done reliably over a dashboard

## Do not

- Build streak/XP/social/coaching surfaces
- Turn Errata into a generic todo mega-app (projects, tags sprawl, kanban)
- Add cloud or accounts by default
- Port to Windows before Android MVP is usable on a real device
- Reuse the name UpKeep (taken CMMS) or collide with Borrowed / Drift products
